  [1m[36mTask Update (2.2ms)[0m  [1m[33mUPDATE "tasks" SET "updated_at" = '2026-03-16 20:11:37.276338', "description_adf" = '{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"codeBlock","content":[{"type":"text","text":"To all customers of Virksomhedsindsats.JobannonceService\n\nThe following changes will be made in the upcoming release 2025-2, which will be implemented during the weekend of June 13-15, 2025:\n\nImport of job advertisements\nSeveral customers of Virksomhedsindsats.JobannonceService version 2 have requested the possibility of being able to download Greenlandic job advertisements for display on their own job portal. With the upcoming release, it will be possible to download Greenlandic job advertisements.\n\nExport of job advertisements\nCustomers of Virksomhedsindsats.JobannonceService should be aware that an adjustment is being made to the Create and Update Job Advertisement methods on (version 2) of JobannonceService to not allow http:// and ftp://, as it does not make sense as a link to an application in a job advertisement.\nWhen specifying http:// and ftp://, a specific error is thrown, telling the customer that only https:// is allowed"}]},{"type":"codeBlock"}]}' WHERE "tasks"."id" = 139 /*application='Gold'*/[0m
