  [1m[36mTask Update (2.5ms)[0m  [1m[33mUPDATE "tasks" SET "updated_at" = '2026-03-16 20:11:37.289567', "description_adf" = '{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"As a recruiter I want to be able to use the test “TT38” the same way I use “DISC”"}]},{"type":"rule"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hi Kacper,"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Please find attached the API description of the API and a postman collection for easily testing the endpoints. "}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that this is our "},{"type":"text","text":"test-environment","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" so while it should generally be stable and working, there might be outages because we are working on other projects at the same time. "}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A few notes: "}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"In the collection, a client ID and client secret for generating tokens is included. These have been setup by me in the test-environment. In the production environment, you will have access to the backoffice where you can create and revoke these secrets. "}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can choose between “en” and “da” as language. However, in the account I’m using, there are multiple projects with English as language, so you must specify a project_id field as well, as shown below:"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"mediaSingle","attrs":{"layout":"align-start"},"content":[{"type":"media","attrs":{"type":"file","id":"c4b2da30-1077-47bf-8856-95a720ecadd6","alt":"Screenshot 2024-08-23 at 14.05.08.png","collection":"","height":180,"width":321}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This shouldn’t be an issue in production, since normally, you would only have one test (i.e., project) per language. In any case, it can be handled by adding the project_id field. If you omit the field, you will get helpful error message. "}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since it is the test-environment, there is a possibility to generate the answers, so you don’t have to go through all the statements before testing that the callback works. Simply press “Mock answers” to do so:"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"mediaSingle","attrs":{"layout":"align-start"},"content":[{"type":"media","attrs":{"type":"file","id":"de6aa68a-9391-4fe7-b953-ebbfa7645159","alt":"Screenshot 2024-08-23 at 14.05.04.png","collection":"","height":325,"width":422}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"hardBreak"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you send report to both candidate and company, you will notice that both parties receive the same email, i.e., they can see each other’s email addresses. This is a known bug that we will fix – they should be sent separately."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you choose to send report to candidate or company (or both), you will also notice that there will be a delay between receiving the mail with a link to the report and receiving the information through the callback. The reason for this is that we need to generate the PDF, and this happens in a job that runs every 10 minutes or so. Hopefully, this isn’t an issue."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Enjoy testing and let me know of any issues you run into."}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"-Andreas"}]}]}' WHERE "tasks"."id" = 142 /*application='Gold'*/[0m
