  [1m[36mTask Update (1.7ms)[0m  [1m[33mUPDATE "tasks" SET "updated_at" = '2026-03-16 20:11:37.647954', "sprint_name" = NULL, "sprint_id" = NULL, "description_adf" = '{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"https://www.loom.com/share/e23c244546a54421b5cf5eaba4593ba4","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://www.loom.com/share/e23c244546a54421b5cf5eaba4593ba4"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Some of the candidate does not have the little icon showing that there has been made a comment. It seems to be completely random. "}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have previously seen a similar issue with Erik Arkitekter. They had used the chat-function as a commentsection. When exploring that, I noticed that not all candidates displayed the chat icon, even though there was an ongoing conversation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have tested the functionality myself, but I am currently not experiencing the same issue."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The customer who im using as an example is Viborg Private Realskole, who called in as it is quite annoying for them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Position no: 33673"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Candidate no (the ones that do not have the icon showing):"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"195742"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"629007"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"628227"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"628553"}]},{